* A15:BYE - PRIVATE BYE BACKEND

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* A15:BYE - PRIVATE BYE BACKEND

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    A15:BYE

Private service component in the SYSTEM high user area. The public A0:BYE
entry point has a different role and authorization. Do not add A15: to the
caller search path or launch a second service inside an active session.

For normal caller logoff use BYE from A0. For local host shutdown use
SYSUTLS:BYEBYE after callers disconnect.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
